---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL, CLARITY_ID } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Privacy policy of ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}: your income stays on your device`} description="What the benefits calculators process: no cookie, no account, no income or household data kept by the publisher. Your rights under the GDPR and US state privacy laws." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers {SITE_URL}. To estimate SNAP, Medicaid or a tax credit you have to describe your household, your pay and your rent, which is exactly the kind of information that should not travel. The calculators were therefore written to run entirely in your browser. The publisher is established in France, so the EU General Data Protection Regulation applies to everything the site does, for every visitor; residents of US states with a consumer privacy law keep at least the rights below.</p>
    <p>This site sets no cookie, and the calculators store nothing on your device.</p>
    <h2>1. Who is responsible</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>2. What never leaves your browser</h2>
    <p>Household size, ages, earnings, Social Security or unemployment income, rent, utility bills, child care costs, immigration or disability status: all of it is processed by code running on your own device and is never sent to us, to an agency or to anyone else. The "copy share link" button writes your figures into the page address so you can send the calculation to a caseworker or a relative; whoever receives that link can read them, so choose who gets it.</p>
    <h2>3. What is processed</h2>
    <h3>Hosting logs</h3><p>Like every web host, GitHub records the IP address, time, requested page and browser type of each request to keep the service secure. Legal basis: legitimate interest. Retention follows GitHub's policy.</p>
    {CLARITY_ID
      ? <><h3>Anonymous stability monitoring, without cookies</h3><p>To find broken pages, the site loads Microsoft Clarity (Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, Dublin) in cookie-free mode: errors, load times, dead clicks and scrolling are measured per page view, without cookies and without linking visits, and page content and everything typed are masked. Microsoft receives the technical data of the request, including the IP address. Recordings are kept 30 days and aggregates up to 13 months. Legal basis: legitimate interest in a working site (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR). You can object by blocking clarity.ms or by writing to us.</p></>
      : <><h3>No analytics</h3><p>No audience measurement, advertising or social media tool runs on this site today. If a stability monitoring tool is added, this page will name it and say what it records, before it is switched on.</p></>}
    <h3>Emails</h3><p>If you write to us, we keep your address and message to answer, and delete them three years after the last exchange. Please do not send case numbers, Social Security numbers or copies of notices: the amount you question and your state are enough.</p>
    <h2>4. No sale, no sharing</h2><p>We do not sell personal information, do not share it for cross-context behavioral advertising and do not build profiles. There is no advertising on the site.</p>
    <h2>5. Recipients and transfers</h2><p>The host, GitHub, Inc., is in the United States; request data may be processed there under the EU–US Data Privacy Framework.</p>
    <h2>6. Your rights</h2><p>You may ask for access, correction, deletion, restriction or portability, or object to processing, by writing to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>; we answer within one month. You may also complain to the {LEGAL.supervisoryAuthority} (<a href={LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl}</a>).</p>
    <h2>7. Children</h2><p>The site is meant for adults managing a household budget. It is not directed at children under 13 and collects nothing from them.</p>
    <p>See also the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a> and the <a href={route('terms', lang)}>legal notice</a>. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
